   "type": "file",
   "name": "pdf.test.tsx",
   "filePath": "__tests__/pdf.test.tsx",
   "summary": "Node-environment Vitest suite that renders the devis/facture @react-pdf/renderer document (BillingDocument) with a full company identity, with a blank one, and across 60 lines to force pagination, plus a unit check that pdfMoney() encodes with a plain space Helvetica can render.",
